ENTITY CX4A
QUALIFY CX4A kind context
QUALIFY CX4A type tau_CX
QUALIFY CX4A base_type tau_A
QUALIFY CX4A distinguishes_type tau_A
QUALIFY CX4A member A1
QUALIFY CX4A member A2
QUALIFY CX4A member A3

ENTITY CX4V
QUALIFY CX4V kind context
QUALIFY CX4V type tau_CX
QUALIFY CX4V base_type tau_V
QUALIFY CX4V distinguishes_type tau_V
QUALIFY CX4V member V1
QUALIFY CX4V member V2
QUALIFY CX4V member V3

ENTITY CX4
QUALIFY CX4 kind context
QUALIFY CX4 type tau_CX
QUALIFY CX4 base_type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
QUALIFY CX4 distinguishes_type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
QUALIFY CX4 member A1V1
QUALIFY CX4 member A1V2
QUALIFY CX4 member A1V3
QUALIFY CX4 member A2V1
QUALIFY CX4 member A2V2
QUALIFY CX4 member A2V3
QUALIFY CX4 member A3V1
QUALIFY CX4 member A3V2
QUALIFY CX4 member A3V3

ENTITY U8
QUALIFY U8 kind stream
QUALIFY U8 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U8 I0 A1V2
AT U8 I1 A2V1
AT U8 I2 A3V3

ENTITY U9
QUALIFY U9 kind stream
QUALIFY U9 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U9 I0 A3V1
AT U9 I1 A1V3
AT U9 I2 A2V2

ENTITY U10
QUALIFY U10 kind stream
QUALIFY U10 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U10 I0 A1V3
AT U10 I1 A2V1

ENTITY T4
QUALIFY T4 kind task
QUALIFY T4 context CX4
QUALIFY T4 input U8
QUALIFY T4 input U9
QUALIFY T4 input U10

UNKNOWN_AT T4 X4 U10 I2 Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
